<center><h3>Gaza Community Mental Health programme</h3></center>
Please sign my <a href="/sites/gcmhp.net/cgi-bin/guestbook/add.htm">guestbook</a>.
<hr><p><br>
<b>Dr. Ashraf Kagee<br>My best wishes to everyone at the GCMHP as you continue with your very important work in serving humanity. Peace and blessings.</b><br><a href="mailto:sakagee@mail.med.upenn.edu" style="pointer-events: none;">sakagee@mail.med.upenn.edu</a></p><p>
<a href="/sites/gcmhp.net/cgi-bin/guestbook/www.canada.com" class="dead" aria-disabled="true"><b>Dr.Marvin F. Zayed </b></a><b><br>I was very touched by the humanistic scholarly works of your resaerch. We wish to have your permission to re-publish some of your materials  as a documents in our:MAFKAR.. DIAHUMANSIM FORUM FORE FREE THOGHT ..DEFENDING HUMAN RIGHTS ISSUES IN ARABIC/ISLAMIC SOCIETIES , which contains a special section for Palestine .A Copy of our forum well be send to you after we finish the final touches of issue No.01 soon.
Please add our name on your lists and keep us informed.
All the best,to all of you,specially Dr.El-Saraj whom I`ll be honoured to be in contact with soon.
Dr.Marvin F. Zayed,President of Diahumanism Institute ,Editor in Chief. P.O.BOX 339 STATION-A ,OTTAWA,ONTARIO,K1N8V3,CANADA.
</b><br><a href="mailto:diahumanism@canada.com" style="pointer-events: none;">diahumanism@canada.com</a></p><p>
<b>Adnan Al-Sabah <br>I am just proud of you all. Good luck.</b><br><a href="mailto:aa@lawyer.com" style="pointer-events: none;">aa@lawyer.com</a></p><p>
<b>Rebecca Stich<br>I have known for quite some time about the GCMHP, and hope some day to see your programs in person. Until then, keep up the good work, wa as-salaam.</b><br><a href="mailto:rebecca@fsassp.almaty.kz" style="pointer-events: none;">rebecca@fsassp.almaty.kz</a></p><p>
<b>moussa<br>thank you for your services</b><br><a href="mailto:moussa@gcmhp.net" style="pointer-events: none;">moussa@gcmhp.net</a></p><p>
<b>robert semeniuk<br>I shall return</b><br><a href="mailto:alternateroutes@compuserve.com" style="pointer-events: none;">alternateroutes@compuserve.com</a></p><p>
<b>Emily Christensen<br>I am happy to hear of your success and activity thus far!  I also am wondering if you use any sort of art (visual) therapy in your work.</b><br><a href="mailto:eachrist@midway.uchicago.edu" style="pointer-events: none;">eachrist@midway.uchicago.edu</a></p><p>
<a href="http://www.hiak.no" class="dead" aria-disabled="true"><b>Mr. Tor Rynning Torp</b></a><b><br>Dear Sirs;

I am representing Akershus College in Norway. I am impressed about the activity level described on your web pages. I can only wish you good luck!


Sincerely,


Tor Rynning Torp</b><br><a href="mailto:tor.torp@hiak.no" style="pointer-events: none;">tor.torp@hiak.no</a></p><p>
